{"products": [{"id": 7934900011091, "title": "Aida Battle 100g", "handle": "aida-battle-100g", "body_html": "<p class=\"cvGsUA direction-ltr align-start para-style-body\"><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">*2025 crop offering*</span></p>\n<p class=\"cvGsUA direction-ltr align-start para-style-body\"><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">As grain ages it changes, sometimes losing vibrancy.</span></p>\n<p class=\"cvGsUA direction-ltr align-start para-style-body\"><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">This offering is a Kenya process which uses a meticulous \u201cdouble fermentation\u201d wet method. Ripe cherries are pulped to remove the skin. After fermenting in tanks for 12-24 hours, they are washed, and fermented again for 12-24 hours to remove all mucilage before drying on raised beds. This process results in high quality clean cups known for intense acidity, bright &amp; fruity with notes like berries and spice.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Origin: Finca Kilimanjaro</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Region: Santa Ana, El <span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">\u00a0</span>Salvador</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Varietal: SL28, SL34, Bourbon</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Process: Kenya\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Elevation: 1580-1720 masl</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Aptos',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Source: direct trade</span></p>", "published_at": "2026-04-25T10:57:51-04:00", "created_at": "2026-04-22T16:38:32-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-16T10:11:52-04:00", "vendor": "Lume Roasters ", "product_type": "", "tags": [], "variants": [{"id": 44518510755923, "title": "Default Title", "option1": "Default Title", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": false, "price": "10.00", "grams": 113, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 7934900011091, "created_at": "2026-04-22T16:38:32-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-16T10:11:52-04:00"}], "images": [{"id": 41241877971027, "created_at": "2026-04-22T16:51:06-04:00", "position": 1, "updated_at": "2026-04-22T16:51:07-04:00", "product_id": 7934900011091, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0671/5939/2339/files/baglabel_productpage_4.svg?v=1776891067", "width": 480, "height": 480}], "options": [{"name": "Title", "position": 1, "values": ["Default Title"]}]}, {"id": 8059016970323, "title": "Chelchele 100g", "handle": "chelchele", "body_html": "<div>\n<div>Chelchele is a washing station that buys coffee from hundreds of very small scale farmers in the surrounding\u00a0villages. Its high altitude slows plant maturation, producing smaller, very dense coffee.\u00a0</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>In the cup, we find a delicate super tea like coffee with a big aroma, featuring bergamot, gardenia, and some allspice. As the cup cools we get more stone fruit peach, apricot, and some plum with a touch of honey.</div>\n<div></div>\n<p><span>Origin: \u00a0Banko Chelchele, Gedeb, Ethiopia</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span>Process: Washed</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span>Varietal: Landrace</span></p>\n<p><span>Altitude: 1900-2200 masl</span></p>\n<p><span>Tasting Notes: </span>Bergamot, Gardenia, Peach</p>\n<p>Roast Level: Light\u00a0</p>\n<p>Source: Sweet Maria</p>\n</div>", "published_at": "2026-08-29T11:34:26-04:00", "created_at": "2026-08-19T19:11:33-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-16T10:11:52-04:00", "vendor": "Lume Roasters", "product_type": "", "tags": [], "variants": [{"id": 46002141003859, "title": "Default Title", "option1": "Default Title", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": true, "price": "15.00", "grams": 113, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 8059016970323, "created_at": "2026-08-19T19:11:33-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-16T10:11:52-04:00"}], "images": [{"id": 42130963595347, "created_at": "2026-08-19T19:18:20-04:00", "position": 1, "updated_at": "2026-08-19T19:18:22-04:00", "product_id": 8059016970323, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0671/5939/2339/files/bag_label_product_page_5.png?v=1787181502", "width": 1500, "height": 1500}], "options": [{"name": "Title", "position": 1, "values": ["Default Title"]}]}, {"id": 8059060322387, "title": "Dabaye 100g", "handle": "dabaye-100g", "body_html": "<div>\n<div><br></div>\n<p>Dabaye is a small coffee-growing community in Hambela, in Ethiopia\u2019s Guji Zone. Local smallholder farmers deliver their cherries to the washing station managed by Kedir Hassan.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The dry grounds smell of sweet berry juice. In bloom, intense florals emerge alongside bright citrus and earthy coriander. The cup is juicy, with nectarine and orange leading into a soft pear-like sweetness.\u00a0</p>\n<p><span>Origin:\u00a0 Hambela, Ethiopia</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span>Process: Washed</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span>Varietal: Landrace</span></p>\n<p><span>Altitude:\u00a0 1800-2200masl</span></p>\n<p><span>Tasting Notes: Nectarine, Floral, Coriander</span></p>\n<p>Roast Level: Light\u00a0</p>\n<p>Source: Sweet Maria</p>\n</div>", "published_at": "2026-08-29T11:34:11-04:00", "created_at": "2026-08-19T19:47:56-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-16T10:11:52-04:00", "vendor": "Lume Roasters", "product_type": "", "tags": [], "variants": [{"id": 46002214273107, "title": "Default Title", "option1": "Default Title", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": true, "price": "15.00", "grams": 113, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 8059060322387, "created_at": "2026-08-19T19:47:56-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-16T10:11:52-04:00"}], "images": [{"id": 42131211780179, "created_at": "2026-08-19T19:49:53-04:00", "position": 1, "updated_at": "2026-08-19T19:49:55-04:00", "product_id": 8059060322387, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0671/5939/2339/files/bag_label_product_page_7.png?v=1787183395", "width": 1500, "height": 1500}], "options": [{"name": "Title", "position": 1, "values": ["Default Title"]}]}, {"id": 7746674851923, "title": "Gatugi Factory 100g", "handle": "gatugi-factory-100g", "body_html": "<p>\u00a0</p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span>Origin: Nyeri County, Kenya</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span>Process: Washed</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span>Varietal: SL34, SL28, R</span><span>uiru 11 and Batian</span></p>\n<p><span>Tasting Notes:\u00a0</span><span>Grapefruit, Black Tea, Ginger, and Orange Soda</span></p>\n<p>Roast Level: Light\u00a0<br></p>\n</div>", "published_at": "2025-11-06T13:53:47-05:00", "created_at": "2025-11-06T13:50:04-05:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-16T10:11:52-04:00", "vendor": "Lume Roasters ", "product_type": "", "tags": [], "variants": [{"id": 43214728527955, "title": "Default Title", "option1": "Default Title", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": false, "price": "14.00", "grams": 115, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 7746674851923, "created_at": "2025-11-06T13:50:04-05:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-16T10:11:52-04:00"}], "images": [{"id": 40072219918419, "created_at": "2025-11-17T18:12:25-05:00", "position": 1, "updated_at": "2026-01-26T16:04:39-05:00", "product_id": 7746674851923, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0671/5939/2339/files/Gatugi-Factory_3.png?v=1769461479", "width": 1500, "height": 1500}], "options": [{"name": "Title", "position": 1, "values": ["Default Title"]}]}, {"id": 8138474422355, "title": "Kiambu AA 100g", "handle": "kiambu-aa-100g", "body_html": "<div>\n<div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span>The dry aroma smells of ripe stone fruit like blackberry and grapefruit essence. In bloom, soft florals emerge along with some clove. Taste is tangy acidity like tamarind with grapefruit peel and cranberries, finishing with clove.\u00a0</span></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span></span></div>\n</div>\n<p><span>Origin:\u00a0 Kaira-ini, Kiambu, Kenya</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span>Process: Washed</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span>Varietal: SL28, SL34, Ruiru 11</span></p>\n<p><span>Altitude: 1930masl</span></p>\n<p><span>Tasting Notes: Blackberry, Grapefruit, Clove, Tangy</span></p>\n<p>Roast Level: Light\u00a0</p>\n<p>Source: Sweet Maria</p>\n</div>", "published_at": "2026-09-12T10:50:50-04:00", "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:20:23-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-16T10:11:52-04:00", "vendor": "Lume Roasters", "product_type": "", "tags": [], "variants": [{"id": 46205853925459, "title": "Default Title", "option1": "Default Title", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": true, "price": "15.00", "grams": 113, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 8138474422355, "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:20:23-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-16T10:11:52-04:00"}], "images": [{"id": 42433667137619, "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:21:08-04:00", "position": 1, "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:21:10-04:00", "product_id": 8138474422355, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0671/5939/2339/files/bag_label_product_page.png?v=1788974470", "width": 4688, "height": 4688}], "options": [{"name": "Title", "position": 1, "values": ["Default Title"]}]}, {"id": 8016553246803, "title": "Luz Helena Salazar 100g", "handle": "luz-helena-salazar-100g", "body_html": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">This washed Pink Bourbon comes from Luz Helena Salazar in Quind\u00edo, Colombia. With more than 20 years of coffee-growing experience, Luz Helena owns Finca Maracay and co-owns La Leona with her husband, Jairo Arcila. Her sons, Felipe and Carlos, manage processing and export through their company, Cofinet.\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Freshly ground, this coffee opens with aromas of bright citrus and sweetness reminiscent of red blackberries, and black plum. As it brews, the fragrance becomes vividly pink, from sweet pea blossoms and peonies. In the cup, sharp acidity leads into red fruit notes of raspberry and red blackberries, finishing with a touch of honeyed sweetness.</p>\n<p class=\"cvGsUA block-font-kerning-none block-font-feature-liga-off block-font-feature-clig-off block-font-feature-calt-off direction-ltr align-start para-style-body\"><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Country: </span><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Colombia</span></p>\n<p class=\"cvGsUA block-font-kerning-none block-font-feature-liga-off block-font-feature-clig-off block-font-feature-calt-off direction-ltr align-start para-style-body\"><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Region: </span><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Quindio</span></p>\n<p class=\"cvGsUA block-font-kerning-none block-font-feature-liga-off block-font-feature-clig-off block-font-feature-calt-off direction-ltr align-start para-style-body\"><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Process: </span><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Washed</span></p>\n<p class=\"cvGsUA block-font-kerning-none block-font-feature-liga-off block-font-feature-clig-off block-font-feature-calt-off direction-ltr align-start para-style-body\"><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Varietal: </span><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Pink Bourbon</span></p>\n<p class=\"cvGsUA block-font-kerning-none block-font-feature-liga-off block-font-feature-clig-off block-font-feature-calt-off direction-ltr align-start para-style-body\"><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Altitude: 1500masl</span></p>\n<p class=\"cvGsUA block-font-kerning-none block-font-feature-liga-off block-font-feature-clig-off block-font-feature-calt-off direction-ltr align-start para-style-body\"><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Roast Level: </span><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Light</span></p>\n<p class=\"cvGsUA block-font-kerning-none block-font-feature-liga-off block-font-feature-clig-off block-font-feature-calt-off direction-ltr align-start para-style-body\"><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Source: Cofinet</span></p>", "published_at": "2026-07-11T10:53:11-04:00", "created_at": "2026-07-09T14:12:01-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-16T10:11:52-04:00", "vendor": "Lume Roasters ", "product_type": "", "tags": [], "variants": [{"id": 45802966122579, "title": "Default Title", "option1": "Default Title", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": false, "price": "15.00", "grams": 112, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 8016553246803, "created_at": "2026-07-09T14:12:02-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-16T10:11:52-04:00"}], "images": [{"id": 41849436176467, "created_at": "2026-07-09T14:10:12-04:00", "position": 1, "updated_at": "2026-07-09T14:10:14-04:00", "product_id": 8016553246803, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0671/5939/2339/files/baglabel_productpage_3.png?v=1783620614", "width": 1500, "height": 1500}], "options": [{"name": "Title", "position": 1, "values": ["Default Title"]}]}, {"id": 8028876800083, "title": "Pepe Jijon 100g", "handle": "pepe-jijon-100g", "body_html": "<div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">This washed Typica Mejorado uses Pepe's signature TyOxidator method: open-air aerobic fermentation, 48 hours sealed in mucilage, then a slow 20-day sun-dry.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Pepe, the first Latin American to solo climb the Seven Summits, built Finca Soledad into a community farm that employs single mothers, earning him a Sprudgie Award in 2023.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">In the cup: hibiscus and honeydew, an Arnold Palmer-like sweetness, finishing juicy and clean.</p>\n<p><span>Origin: Imbabura, Ecuador</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span>Process: Washed (TyOxidator)</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span>Varietal:\u00a0<span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Typica Mejorado</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Altitude: 1515masl</span></span></p>\n<p><span>Tasting Notes: <span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Hibiscus, Honeydew, Arnold Palmer, Juicy</span></span></p>\n<p>Roast Level: Light\u00a0</p>\n</div>", "published_at": "2026-07-25T11:00:20-04:00", "created_at": "2026-07-24T22:31:19-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-16T10:11:52-04:00", "vendor": "Lume Roasters", "product_type": "", "tags": [], "variants": [{"id": 45863800930387, "title": "Default Title", "option1": "Default Title", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": false, "price": "22.00", "grams": 113, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 8028876800083, "created_at": "2026-07-24T22:31:19-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-16T10:11:52-04:00"}], "images": [{"id": 41936268132435, "created_at": "2026-07-24T22:41:51-04:00", "position": 1, "updated_at": "2026-07-24T22:41:52-04:00", "product_id": 8028876800083, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0671/5939/2339/files/bag_label_product_page_4.png?v=1784947312", "width": 1500, "height": 1500}], "options": [{"name": "Title", "position": 1, "values": ["Default Title"]}]}, {"id": 8100687970387, "title": "Reddit Sample", "handle": "reddit-sample", "body_html": "", "published_at": "2026-09-02T12:39:41-04:00", "created_at": "2026-09-02T12:39:40-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-16T10:11:52-04:00", "vendor": "Lume Roasters ", "product_type": "", "tags": [], "variants": [{"id": 46119575060563, "title": "Default Title", "option1": "Default Title", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": false, "featured_image": null, "available": true, "price": "8.00", "grams": 60, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 8100687970387, "created_at": "2